{
  "id": "bs-k12-integral-mudah-08",
  "nama": "Bank Soal Mudah - Paket 8",
  "kelas": 12,
  "kategori": "Integral Fungsi",
  "tingkat": "MUDAH",
  "deskripsi": "Aplikasi integral (kecepatan, debit, pertumbuhan)",
  "versi": "1.0.0",
  "soal": [
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-mudah-08-q01",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Sebuah mobil bergerak dengan kecepatan yang dinyatakan oleh fungsi $v(t) = 4t + 2$. Jika mobil mulai dari posisi awal $s(0) = 0$, berapa jarak yang ditempuh mobil dalam waktu 3 detik?" }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$24$ meter"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$30$ meter"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$36$ meter"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$42$ meter"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$18$ meter"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Jarak = integral dari kecepatan." },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "s(t) = \\int (4t + 2) \\, dt = 2t^2 + 2t + C" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Karena $s(0)=0$, maka $C=0$. Jarak pada $t=3$: $s(3) = 2(3)^2 + 2(3) = 18 + 6 = 24$ meter." }
      ],
      "tingkat": "MUDAH"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-mudah-08-q02",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Debit air yang mengalir ke dalam tangki adalah $D(t) = 3t^2 - t + 1$ liter per menit. Berapa banyak air yang masuk ke tangki dari menit ke-0 hingga menit ke-3?" }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$15$ liter"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$20$ liter"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$30$ liter"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$35$ liter"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$25{,}5$ liter"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 4,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "V = \\int_{0}^{3} (3t^2 - t + 1) \\, dt = [t^3 - \\dfrac{1}{2}t^2 + t]_{0}^{3}" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= (27 - 4{,}5 + 3) - 0 = 25{,}5 \\text{ liter}" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "MUDAH"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-mudah-08-q03",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Sebuah perusahaan memproduksi barang dengan kecepatan $v(t) = 2t^2 - 3t + 4$ barang per jam. Berapa jumlah barang yang diproduksi dari jam ke-1 hingga jam ke-4?" }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$39{,}5$ barang"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$24$ barang"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$30$ barang"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$32$ barang"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$36$ barang"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "Q = \\int_{1}^{4} (2t^2 - 3t + 4) \\, dt = [\\dfrac{2}{3}t^3 - \\dfrac{3}{2}t^2 + 4t]_{1}^{4}" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= (\\dfrac{128}{3} - 24 + 16) - (\\dfrac{2}{3} - \\dfrac{3}{2} + 4) = \\dfrac{237}{6} = 39{,}5 \\text{ barang}" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "MUDAH"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-mudah-08-q04",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Seorang peneliti mengamati pertumbuhan populasi bakteri yang mengikuti fungsi $P'(t) = 5t^2 + 3$, di mana $t$ adalah waktu dalam jam. Jika $P(0) = 0$, berapa banyak bakteri setelah 2 jam?" }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{58}{3}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$35$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$40$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$50$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$20$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "P(t) = \\int (5t^2 + 3) \\, dt = \\dfrac{5}{3}t^3 + 3t + C" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "$P(0) = 0 \\Rightarrow C = 0$. Maka $P(2) = \\dfrac{5}{3}(8) + 6 = \\dfrac{40}{3} + \\dfrac{18}{3} = \\dfrac{58}{3}$." }
      ],
      "tingkat": "MUDAH"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-mudah-08-q05",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Seorang pelukis menciptakan lukisan yang area permukaannya dinyatakan oleh fungsi laju $A'(x) = x^2 + x + 1$. Jika pelukis ingin mengetahui total area yang telah dilukis dari $x = 1$ hingga $x = 3$, berapa luas area tersebut?" }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{38}{3}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$12$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{44}{3}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{32}{3}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$15$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 2,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "\\int_{1}^{3} (x^2 + x + 1) \\, dx = [\\dfrac{1}{3}x^3 + \\dfrac{1}{2}x^2 + x]_{1}^{3}" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= (9 + 4{,}5 + 3) - (\\dfrac{1}{3} + 0{,}5 + 1) = 16{,}5 - \\dfrac{11}{6} = \\dfrac{88}{6} = \\dfrac{44}{3}" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "MUDAH"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-mudah-08-q06",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Biaya pemeliharaan mesin dinyatakan oleh fungsi laju $B'(x) = x^2 - 2x + 3$ juta rupiah per tahun. Berapa total biaya pemeliharaan dari tahun ke-2 hingga tahun ke-4?" }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{38}{3}$ Juta"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$14$ Juta"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$12$ Juta"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$10$ Juta"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$18$ Juta"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "\\int_{2}^{4} (x^2 - 2x + 3) \\, dx = [\\dfrac{1}{3}x^3 - x^2 + 3x]_{2}^{4}" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= (\\dfrac{64}{3} - 16 + 12) - (\\dfrac{8}{3} - 4 + 6) = \\dfrac{52}{3} - \\dfrac{14}{3} = \\dfrac{38}{3} \\text{ Juta}" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "MUDAH"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-mudah-08-q07",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Hasil panen dinyatakan dengan fungsi laju $H'(x) = 3x^2 - 5x + 2$ ton per minggu. Berapa total hasil panen dari minggu ke-1 hingga minggu ke-3?" }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$10$ ton"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$16$ ton"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$17$ ton"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$18$ ton"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$14$ ton"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "\\int_{1}^{3} (3x^2 - 5x + 2) \\, dx = [x^3 - \\dfrac{5}{2}x^2 + 2x]_{1}^{3}" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= (27 - 22{,}5 + 6) - (1 - 2{,}5 + 2) = 10{,}5 - 0{,}5 = 10 \\text{ ton}" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "MUDAH"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-mudah-08-q08",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Diketahui $\\dfrac{dy}{dx} = 3x^2 - 2x$. Kurva tersebut melewati titik $(2, 5)$. Tentukan persamaan kurva tersebut." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = x^3 - x^2 + 1$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = x^3 - x + 1$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = x^3 - x^2 + 2$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = x^3 - x + 2$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = x^3 - x^2 + 5$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "y = \\int (3x^2 - 2x) \\, dx = x^3 - x^2 + C" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Substitusi $(2,5)$: $5 = 8 - 4 + C \\Rightarrow C = 1$." },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Jadi, $y = x^3 - x^2 + 1$." }
      ],
      "tingkat": "MUDAH"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-mudah-08-q09",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Diketahui $F'(x) = 6x^2 + 2x - 4$ dan $F(2) = 0$, maka $F(x) = \\dots$" }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$2x^3 + x^2 - 4x + 28$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$2x^3 + x^2 - 4x - 8$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$2x^3 + x^2 - 4x - 12$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$2x^3 + x^2 - 2x - 24$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$2x^3 + x^2 - 2x + 24$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 2,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "F(x) = \\int (6x^2 + 2x - 4) \\, dx = 2x^3 + x^2 - 4x + C" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "$F(2) = 0 \\Rightarrow 2(8) + 4 - 8 + C = 0 \\Rightarrow 16 + 4 - 8 + C = 0 \\Rightarrow 12 + C = 0 \\Rightarrow C = -12$." },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Jadi, $F(x) = 2x^3 + x^2 - 4x - 12$." }
      ],
      "tingkat": "MUDAH"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-mudah-08-q10",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Gradien garis singgung kurva $y=f(x)$ di sebarang titik dinyatakan oleh $\\dfrac{dy}{dx} = -3x^2 + 6x$. Kurva melalui titik $(-1, 10)$, maka persamaan kurva adalah ..." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = -x^3 + 3x^2 + 6$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = x^3 + 3x^2 - 6$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = -2x^3 + 3x^2 + 5$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = -x^3 + 3x^2 + 5$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = -x^3 - 3x^2 + 6$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "y = \\int (-3x^2 + 6x) \\, dx = -x^3 + 3x^2 + C" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Substitusi $(-1, 10)$: $10 = -(-1)^3 + 3(-1)^2 + C \\Rightarrow 10 = 1 + 3 + C \\Rightarrow C = 6$." },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Jadi, $y = -x^3 + 3x^2 + 6$." }
      ],
      "tingkat": "MUDAH"
    }
  ]
}
